#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:3 b6659ad0f116433aa28c71a83d7bb68c
msgid "Long Commands"
msgstr "长指令"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:9 1512ec204fed4552bc80d27d902bc42f
msgid ""
"This module is a collection of ``command_long_send`` functions that may be "
"useful to the user."
msgstr "该模块是一组 ``command_long_send`` 函数的集合，可供用户使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:13 641d1170c291432d88f29346f25c73d2
msgid "Control"
msgstr "控制"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:19 936af5f8370845569e8f7a9d0398f709
msgid ""
"If in automated flight mode, set the vehicles target speed to ``N`` m/s."
msgstr "若处于自动飞行模式，将飞行器目标速度设为 ``N`` 米/秒。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:26 98df95b679f348969c6c613e71403402
msgid ""
"Set the target yaw of the vehicle to ``ANGLE`` (0-360), with a maximum "
"angular speed of ``ANGULAR_SPEED`` (deg/sec). ``MODE`` is either 0 (absolute"
" angle) or 1 (relative angle)."
msgstr ""
"将飞行器目标偏航设为 ``ANGLE``（0-360），最大角速度为 ``ANGULAR_SPEED``（度/秒）。``MODE`` 为 "
"0（绝对角度）或 1（相对角度）。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:33 37f4e44f2adb42c292b5d1b5322b2140
msgid ""
"Sends an automated takeoff command to the vehicle. It will consider the "
"takeoff finished at ``ALTITUDE_IN_METERS`` m (relative)."
msgstr "向飞行器发送自动起飞指令。飞行器将在相对高度 ``ALTITUDE_IN_METERS`` 米时认为起飞完成。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:40 b2bf9871adba4e669399a35d09b6d8a5
msgid ""
"Sets a desired vehicle velocity in a local north-east-down (x, y, z) "
"coordinate frame. All velocities in m/s."
msgstr "在本地北-东-下（x, y, z）坐标系中设置飞行器期望速度。所有速度单位为米/秒。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:47 1389dee9ba844976bc6dfea2b8f0b12c
msgid ""
"Sets a desired vehicle position in a local north-east-down (x, y, z) "
"coordinate frame. All positions in m."
msgstr "在本地北-东-下（x, y, z）坐标系中设置飞行器期望位置。所有位置单位为米。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:54 5147b07c019f413787dae247d788c5a6
msgid "Set the desired attitude of the vehicle in quaternion format."
msgstr "以四元数格式设置飞行器期望姿态。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:60 64f504f25fa24c51b6eada2ed2fdabad
msgid ""
"Sets the target position according to the previous mouse click on the map "
"and the target velocity in North-East-Down format (m/s). Uses a global "
"frame."
msgstr "根据地图上的上次鼠标点击位置设置目标位置，并以北-东-下格式（米/秒）设置目标速度。使用全局坐标系。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:67 22b9d793de254d748e05746b6d9f9054
msgid "If in AUTO or GUIDED mode, pause the vehicle's travel."
msgstr "若处于 AUTO 或 GUIDED 模式，暂停飞行器行进。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:73 386ad6e132cf47f28839753c3cb6a70c
msgid "If in AUTO or GUIDED mode, resume the vehicle's travel."
msgstr "若处于 AUTO 或 GUIDED 模式，恢复飞行器行进。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:76 bfafb49163dc4067977431bb53f3b48e
msgid "Camera"
msgstr "相机"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:78 9bcdf299fb9c4fab998dccf0e5301a49
msgid ""
"Note the following commands are not processed by APM, rather they are meant "
"for a companion computer which controls the camera."
msgstr "注意以下命令不由 APM 处理，而是发送给控制相机的协同计算机。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:84 7b1191b3ce8248efb8c6853c357580d8
msgid ""
"Send a MAV_CMD_DO_DIGICAM_CONTROL Mavlink message. Parameters are: "
"M1=Session control e.g. show/hide lens, M2=Zoom's absolute position, "
"M3=Zooming step value to offset zoom from the current position, M4=Focus "
"Locking, Unlocking or Re-locking, M5=Shooting Command, M6=Command Identity, "
"M7=Empty."
msgstr ""
"发送 MAV_CMD_DO_DIGICAM_CONTROL MAVLink "
"消息。参数说明：M1=会话控制（如显示/隐藏镜头），M2=变焦绝对位置，M3=相对当前位置的变焦步进值，M4=对焦锁定/解锁/重新锁定，M5=拍摄命令，M6=命令标识，M7=空。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:92 91366d24c32f4ba9bd86f729083457d6
msgid "Send an old-style MAV_CMD_DO_DIGICAM_CONTROL shooting command."
msgstr "发送旧式 MAV_CMD_DO_DIGICAM_CONTROL 拍摄命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:98 164f31a87fe746518056bd15888b6182
msgid ""
"Send a MAV_CMD_DO_DIGICAM_CONFIGURE Mavlink message. The Parameters are: "
"M1=Modes [P, TV, AV, M], M2=Shutter Speed, M3=F Stop number, M4=ISO Number, "
"M5=Exposure type, M6=Command Identity, M7=Main engine cut-off time before "
"camera trigger in seconds/10 (0 means no cut-off)."
msgstr ""
"发送 MAV_CMD_DO_DIGICAM_CONFIGURE MAVLink 消息。参数说明：M1=模式 [P, TV, AV, "
"M]，M2=快门速度，M3=光圈值，M4=ISO 值，M5=曝光类型，M6=命令标识，M7=相机触发前主引擎关闭时间（秒/10，0 表示不关闭）。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:101 44c84ef235e9497ea729b3f88f5f901a
msgid "Systems"
msgstr "系统"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:107 363dea7944024e44a2879ee436ecffad
msgid ""
"Sends an action to the parachute. ``ACTION`` can be enable, disable or "
"release."
msgstr "向降落伞发送动作指令。``ACTION`` 可为 enable（启用）、disable（禁用）或 release（释放）。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:115 205ab0d94aae4e4cbc6754b59e225951
msgid ""
"Sends an engine control command (MAV_CMD_DO_ENGINE_CONTROL). It can start or"
" stop the engine. Otherwise the full set of options can be specified, with "
"M1=1 or 0 for engine start/stop, M2=   0: Warm start, 1:Cold start. Controls"
" use of choke where applicable, M3=Height delay (meters). This is for "
"commanding engine start only after the vehicle has gained the specified "
"height."
msgstr ""
"发送引擎控制命令（MAV_CMD_DO_ENGINE_CONTROL）。可启动或停止引擎。或者指定完整参数集：M1=1 或 0 "
"表示引擎启动/停止，M2=0 表示热启动，1 表示冷启动（控制阻风门的使用），M3=高度延迟（米），仅在飞行器达到指定高度后才命令引擎启动。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/cmdlong.rst:122 2bffa254d4fd44c592b6be07366249b3
msgid ""
"Send a general MAV_CMD_LONG message to the vehicle. ``COMMAND`` is the name "
"of the command. The options follow in ``[arg1] [arg2] ...`` format."
msgstr ""
"向飞行器发送通用 MAV_CMD_LONG 消息。``COMMAND`` 为命令名称，选项以 ``[arg1] [arg2] ...`` 格式跟随。"
